WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.560
Guys CS:GO can get pretty serious sometimes.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:11.460
Round by round, decision by decision, the stress is real.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.960
I mean do we eco, do we go aggressive, should we stack a site.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.140
Should I buy head armour?

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:19.140
Or 'nades. It's all too much sometimes.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:23.980
That's why occasionally you just got to chill out and buy that shotgun.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:27.940
I mean I don't know about you, but to me nothing lightens the mood in a server.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.900
Like a good old XM rush.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:35.420
That's right guys get pumped up (See what I did there). This week we're taking a look at the Top 10 Shotgun

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:36.980
Kills in CS:GO

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:42.660
Kicking off our list at number 10 is CLG’s

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:48.660
Hazed, who pulled off an incredible feat during ESL ESEA Pro League Season 1.

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:52.860
Looking to build up some money for the next round against Team Liquid, hazed puts his

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:58.920
trusty shotgun to good use by mowing down TL, one terrorist after another.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:27.600
(Casting)

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:35.180
Coming in  at number 9, we have TSM’s Dev1ce, who, with his team in the lead decided to take

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:38.040
down most of Penta Esports in style.

00:01:38.080 --> 00:02:35.440
(Casting)

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:41.900
Next up our list is GeT_RiGhT who pulled off a jaw dropping ace against Natus Vincere,

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:44.740
during Fragbite Masters 2014.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:51.079
Using the Mag-7 to its fullest on Train, GeT_RiGhT decimates the CIS squad, proving that no matter

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:55.040
what weapons you give him, the Swedish legend will make it work.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:03:12.600
(Casting)

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:18.220
Who says flicks are just for AWPs.

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:24.000
Coming at number 7 is GODSENT’s Doplan who, at ESL Pro League Season 6, proved that shotgun

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:25.840
flicks are just as sick.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:32.040
With Envy already on Cache’s B-site, Doplan found himself trapped with only a mag-7 in hand.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:34.480
But of course, he didn’t see it that way.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:55.200
(Casting)

00:03:56.200 --> 00:04:00.040
Nothing spells confidence more than running through a molly with a shotty.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:03.180
Which is why Flusha comes in at number six on our list.

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:08.900
Taking on Vexed Gaming during StarSeries Season 14, Fnatic found themselves with a commanding

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:14.580
lead, and with the round coming to an end Flusha decided it was time to go hunting.

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:39.000
(Casting)

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:43.580
I’d imagine at this point you might be getting tired of the Mag-7.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:50.260
Well we're not. Since time and time again pros have been able to pop off heads and make it flashy.

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:55.380
That's not different here with NBK showing us just how versatile he is as a player

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:59.360
And unfortunately for Dignitas, they’d be used as the demonstration dummies

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:17.360
(Casting)

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:23.380
At number 4 we have Fnatic’s Olofmeister at ESL One Cologne 2014.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:28.000
On the cusp of losing the map to Virtus.Pro, The Swedes needed to come up with some sort

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.660
of brilliant play to save themselves.

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:35.200
So what better than letting Olofmeister live up to his famous Olofpass nickname.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:06:01.180
(Casting)

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:05.560
Shotguns are big guns, so we thought that the number three spot on our list should be

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:08.580
held down by the man with biggest guns in CS:GO

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:13.580
Most player don’t like taking too many risks with their money during the semifinal of a

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:17.080
Major, but then again, most players aren’t PashaBiceps.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:24.540
And at ESL Once Cologne 2016, Pasha used a Mag-7 to remind SK Gaming exactly why VP

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:26.720
are Counter-Strike legends.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:50.080
(Casting)

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:55.020
Is it actually possible to be sneaky with a shotgun?

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:59.520
Well apparently Tizian thought so and wanted to prove it against DRUCKSWELLE esports in

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.680
ESL’s Meisterschaft league.

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:07.200
Already ahead 5 rounds, Tizian decided to change things up and buy a Nova before putting

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:13.400
on his best Stewie2k impression and kindly showing Druckswelle the power of his boomstick.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:37.200
(Casting)

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:43.300
Taking the number one spot, with his second appearance on this list is Swedish legend

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:49.220
GeT_RiGhT, who scored an unbelievable ace against CPLAY at NorthCon 2012.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:54.420
With everyone still trying to figure out the ins and outs of CS:GO, few players knew what

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:57.420
weapons to expect when it came to an eco round.

00:07:57.420 --> 00:08:02.400
So with no armor against a full buy, GeT_RiGhT went on to set the standard for what makes

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:04.400
a great shotgun play.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:50.480
(Casting)

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:54.360
Well guys that's our list of the TOp 10 Shotgun Kills in CS:GO

00:08:54.360 --> 00:09:00.100
Now look, if you're looking for more venomous gaming athleticism, be sure to check out our Story

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.940
of Dr. Disrespect and that's dropping this Saturday.

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:05.820
That's all for me though guys and I will see you next time.

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:12.200
Thanks for watching. If you want more great content just like this, be sure to hit the subscribe button.

